cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "Flight-test the fly: code and data for \"Flight-testing a fruit-fly connectome as an aircraft yaw damper\""
abstract: >-
  Code, results and replay app for a study that runs a 20,556-neuron FlyWire v783 fruit-fly
  subcircuit (the Shiu et al. 2024 spiking model) as a rudder yaw damper on a two-state yaw model and
  the JSBSim Cessna 172, and tests it like a flight-control law: frequency response, stability
  margins, turbulence rejection and neuron loss, against degree-preserving rewirings and a classical
  yaw damper. Interactive replay and paper: https://fly.aryawijaya.com
version: "1.0.0"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Aryawijaya
    given-names: Mutaqin
repository-code: "https://github.com/aryawidjaja/flight-test-the-fly"
url: "https://fly.aryawijaya.com"
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-10-05"
keywords:
  - connectome
  - FlyWire
  - spiking neural network
  - yaw damper
  - flight control
